{"4598370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ORUN", "steam_appid": 4598370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598370/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1779960797\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city in the middle of the desert has just been taken over by a swarm of monsters. Orun must save it by relighting the guardian flame that protected the now ruined city. Even though he is just a scout he will make his way through the enemies defeating all kinds of golems and bosses until reaching the flame tower after all his kin has fallen.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598370/extras/d0706a40d365f3386640671548410edb.poster.avif?t=1779960797\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598370/extras/d0706a40d365f3386640671548410edb.webm?t=1779960797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598370/extras/d0706a40d365f3386640671548410edb.mp4?t=1779960797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598370/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1779960797\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orun </strong>is a 3D <i>rogue-like</i>, <i>hack and slash</i> adventure video game with an isometric point of view in 3rd person in which the player will have to pass through different rooms full of enemies, find the way to open paths to reach the 